@startuml
title US-006 - Choose plan before registering - SSD level 1
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Nexo" as System

note over Admin, System
  No plan available, and reaching the organization/admin form without a plan
  chosen first, are not yet defined (see US-006 exceptions).
end note

Admin -> System: Open the register-org link
activate System
System --> Admin: Show available plans (name, member limit)
deactivate System

Admin -> System: Pick a plan and continue
activate System
System --> Admin: Continue to the organization/admin form with the plan carried through
deactivate System
@enduml
